From 9485d5ebb74065a396faecdffc958befd7c9b2a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James Lacroix <jlacroix82@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:43:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] perf(serving): admit a buffered text batch in one engine
 message

Opt in on the batch chat endpoint via x-atomic-admission: 1 (or x-tp8-atomic-admission: 1). Validate and register bounded greedy text requests before submitting a single engine-core queue item. Keeps ordinary admission as the default and closes collectors on cancellation. Includes unit tests from PR #1141.
